CB007219_AA02_Verify_A1_scell_addition_in_alternative_band_as_higher_DL_aggregated_channel_bandwidth
    [Documentation]
    ...    1. This user scenario describes the successful setup of inter-band CA with the SCell selected in the alternative band because it provides
    ...    higher DL aggregated channel bandwidth. This case is for A1 scell addition.
    ...    2. Configuration
    ...    CB007219:NRBTS/actMfbiNrCaSupportFr1 is set to "true"
    ...    5GC001416:NRBTS/actMultiFrequencyBandIndicatorNRSupport=true
    ...    UE1 capability: CA relation: cell13+cell14+cell1+cell2, A1 scell addition
    ...    BC#1: n2A-n78(2A)           N2    N78    N78
    ...    FSEI#1    DL MIMO layers    4L    2L    2L
    ...              DL ChBw (MHz)     20    100    100
    ...    BC#2: n2(2A)- n77(2A)       N2    N2    N77    N77
    ...    FSEI#1    DL MIMO layers    2L    2L    2L    2L
    ...              DL ChBw (MHz)     20    20    100    100
    ...    A1 for scell addition is configured in PCell and A2 for scell is configured in SCells.
    ...    3. Test Case Steps:
    ...    a. attach UE1 to cell13, and trigger A1 for scell addition. Start DL/UL traffic.
    ...    expected cell14, cell1 and cell2 are added as scells successfully. 5G-UE serving cells and respective measurement objects are configured
    ...    at 5G-UE to operate as follows: Cell13 in band n2, Cell14 in band n2, Cell1 in band n77, Cell2 in band n77. BC#2FSEI#1 is selected.
    ...    traffic is OK.
    ...    b. relase scells one by one.
    ...    expected BC and FSEI is not changed when at least one scell is still configured.
    ...    c. check counters.
    [Tags]    QC_320592    christine.chen    AA02    CA_LABEL-FFTT(20MHZ_FDD_n2+20MHZ_FDD_n2+100MHZ_TDD_n77+100MHZ_TDD_n77)
