CB007219_AA07_Check_of_simultaneous_RX-TX_CA_inter-band_UE_capability_for_CA_with_MFBI_enable
    [Documentation]
    ...    1. This user scenario verifies that UE can be or cannot be configured with inter-band CA depending on support of
    ...    simultaneousRxTxInterBandCA IE in UE capabilities and different frame structure combinations configured for TDD carriers in gNB.
    ...    2. Configuration
    ...    CB007219:NRBTS/actMfbiNrCaSupportFr1 is set to "true"
    ...    5GC001416:NRBTS/actMultiFrequencyBandIndicatorNRSupport=true
    ...    cell2 and cell3 have different frame structure
    ...    CA relation: cell13+cell11+cell12+cell1, A1 scell addition
    ...    UE1 capability: 5G-UE does not support (bandCombination->CA-ParametersNR->)simultaneousRxTxInterBandCA for any band combination.
    ...    BC#1: n25A-n66A-n71A-n77A    N25    N66    N71    N77
    ...    FSEI#1    DL MIMO layers     2L    2L    2L    4L
    ...              DL ChBw (MHz)    20    20    20    100
    ...    FSEI#2    DL MIMO layers    4L    2L    2L    2L
    ...              DL ChBw (MHz)    20    20    20    100
    ...    BC#2: n25A-n66A-n71A-n78A    N25    N66    N71    N78
    ...    FSEI#1    DL MIMO layers    2L    2L    2L    4L
    ...              DL ChBw (MHz)    20    20    20    100
    ...    FSEI#2    DL MIMO layers    4L    2L    2L    2L
    ...              DL ChBw (MHz)    20    20    20    100
    ...    UE2 capability: CA relation: Cell_2+cell_3, bind scell addition. 5G-UE does not support (bandCombination->CA-ParametersNR->)
    ...    simultaneousRxTxInterBandCA for any band combination.
    ...    BC#1: n38A- n78A    N38    N78
    ...    FSEI#1    DL MIMO layers    4L    2L
    ...              DL ChBw (MHz)    20    100
    ...    BC#2: n41A-n78A    n41    n78
    ...    FSEI#1    DL MIMO layers    2L    2L
    ...              DL ChBw (MHz)    100    100
    ...    3. Test Case Steps:
    ...    a. attach UE1 to cell13, and trigger A1 for scell addition. Try to add scell cell11 cell12 and cell1. Start DL/UL traffic.
    ...    expected only cell11 and cell12 are added as scells successfully. 5G-UE serving cells and respective measurement objects are configured
    ...    at 5G-UE to operate as follows: Cell13 in band n25, Cell11 in band n66, Cell12 in band n71.
    ...    cell1 & cell2 not selected since simultaneousRxTxInterBandCA not support(simultaneousRxTxInterBandCA must set support if FDD as pcell,
    ...    TDD as scell). BC#1FSEI#1 is selected since featureCNI81817 is not enabled. traffic is ok.
    ...    b. attach UE2 to cell2 and try to add scell cell1 blindly. Start DL/UL traffic.
    ...    expected no scell is added and no BC is selected.
    ...    c. check counters.
    [Tags]    QC_320590    christine.chen    AA07    CA_LABEL-FFTT(20MHZ_FDD_n25+20MHZ_FDD_n66+20MHZ_FDD_n71+100MHZ_TDD_n77)
