    ...    configured with an alternative band at equal maximum aggregated channel. When CNI-81817 is disabled, at equal maximum aggregated
    ...    channel, gNB-CU selects the first matching FLS. Here it assumed that gNB always starts building FLSs for the cell native bands.
    ...    2. Configuration
    ...    NRBTS/actMfbiNrCaSupportFr1 is set to true
